// Runtime-spawnable networked physics cube: on a LIVE server the Network component gets a dynamic
// netId at spawn and the spawn replicates to every client (Spawn message + transform/physics sync
// + Despawn on destroy). Key U in the App throws one ahead of the camera, server-side only.
Prefab netPhysCube
	Scale 0.25
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
		Restitution 0.4
		Density 400
	Component Network
